---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import avatar from '../assets/avatar.jpg';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 · Zpero" description="关于 Zpero 和这个小站。">
  <main class="subpage mx-auto min-h-[76vh] max-w-[820px] pb-16 pt-[126px] sm:pt-[140px]">
    <header class="mb-9 border-b border-[#171717]/10 pb-8 sm:mb-11 sm:pb-9">
      <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[.14em] text-[#171717]/45"><span>BEHIND THE SCREEN / 关于</span><span>HELLO, WORLD</span></div>
      <h1 class="text-[34px] font-bold tracking-[-.065em] sm:text-[40px]">关于我<span class="ml-2 text-[#CBF033]">.</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-[660px] text-[13px] leading-[1.9] text-[#171717]/60 sm:text-[14px]">一些关于站长、正在关注的技术，以及这个小站存在的理由。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid items-start gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[166px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-10">
      <aside class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-[12px] border border-zinc-200/70 bg-white px-5 py-7 text-center sm:sticky sm:top-[108px]">
        <div class="h-[92px] w-[92px] overflow-hidden rounded-full border-[3px] border-white bg-[#c7eaf2] shadow-[0_8px_20px_-12px_rgba(30,60,70,.2)]"><Image src={avatar} alt="Zpero 的插画头像" class="avatar-photo h-full w-full" width={92} height={92} /></div>
        <strong class="mt-4 text-[16px] tracking-[-.055em]">Zpero</strong>
        <span class="mt-1 text-[10px] text-[#171717]/45">Java · Backend · Notes</span>
        <span class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1.5 text-[9px] font-medium text-zinc-600"><i class="h-[5px] w-[5px] rounded-full bg-[#CBF033]"></i>持续学习中</span>
      </aside>
      <div class="space-y-8 text-[13px] leading-[2] text-[#171717]/65 sm:text-[14px]">
        <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.04em] text-[#171717]">你好，我是 Zpero</h2><p>我主要关注 Java 后端、AI 应用和实际项目中的工程问题。这个小站用来保存值得回看的技术记录，也容纳一些关于设计与生活的思考。</p></section>
        <section class="border-t border-[#171717]/10 pt-7"><h2 class="mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.04em] text-[#171717]">为什么做这个网站</h2><p>比起不断增加功能，我更希望它保持清楚、安静和容易维护。文章使用 Markdown 管理，封面随内容一起进入 Git，页面由 Astro 生成。</p></section>
        <section class="border-t border-[#171717]/10 pt-7"><h2 class="mb-3 text-[19px] font-bold tracking-[-.04em] text-[#171717]">正在关注</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded bg-white px-3 py-1.5 ring-1 ring-zinc-200">Java / Spring</span><span class="rounded bg-white px-3 py-1.5 ring-1 ring-zinc-200">AI 应用</span><span class="rounded bg-white px-3 py-1.5 ring-1 ring-zinc-200">可观测性</span><span class="rounded bg-white px-3 py-1.5 ring-1 ring-zinc-200">内容设计</span></div></section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
